From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Holland <samuel@sholland.org>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 07:28:37 +0900
Subject: drm/sun4i: add D1 HDMI controller and PHY support

Drive the D1 HDMI PHY with the register sequence from the D1 port.
Use regmap access and bounded calibration, PLL and transmitter waits.
Keep the existing variants on their clock and PHY paths.
Group the static PHY and PLL field writes. Keep the power sequence one step per write.
Drop unused register definitions.

Link: https://github.com/smaeul/linux/commit/90e546a5e7d05b8b014e2bbe085207f6565f6559
Link: https://github.com/smaeul/linux/commit/9935c98040663f00f0bb1c73c6293306bdc1fc54
Link: https://github.com/smaeul/linux/commit/511fe66b9b5a868d1f3573ada5a044a561272181
Signed-off-by: Samuel Holland <samuel@sholland.org>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_dw_hdmi.c  |  14 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_dw_hdmi.h  |  83 ++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_hdmi_phy.c | 188 ++++++++++
 3 files changed, 284 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

